# Agentic attack detections by ThreatDefence: Agentic Bug Hunter
# https://github.com/ThreatDefence/agentic-attack-detections
# Suricata 7 and 8. SID range 3819701-3819749. HTTP rules need cleartext HTTP or decrypted traffic.
# Strings from awarexone/Agentic-Bug-Hunter at 82f4512e (package version 6.0.1). The toolkit is promoted to bug bounty
# hunters: a match means its scripts ran against you, so check whether the test was agreed or in a program's scope.
# The Hunt Dashboard (default 127.0.0.1:8777) is plain HTTP, so its rules work without decryption.

# --- Requests that reach your targets ---
